  triage:title "Routing not collapsed to one decision point" ;
  triage:description "Item 3 of user-mandated 9-point ack/send routing unification checklist VIOLATED. Two independent local-vs-remote branches exist: dispatch_compose_send (runtime_health/dispatch_delivery.rs:87-95, if-let pattern) for send, and DaemonNonClaudeOutbound::deliver_payloads (non_claude_outbound_runtime.rs:74-98, if-let pattern) for ack/non-Claude outbound. Same semantic local-vs-remote decision implemented twice in independent call chains, not one shared decision point." ;
